  "colorTheme": "light",
  "heading": "An opportunity in artistry for Haven’s architects, for a residence defined by quiet elegance, expansive openness, and a seamless dialogue with the landscape beyond.",
  "content": "<p>The Ascot Residence was conceived for clients evolving from apartment living, to a home designed for openness and entertaining, with elegance. Every design decision prioritises seamless flow between indoor and outdoor spaces, combining functionality with refined aesthetics. Integrated joinery, hidden appliances and carefully positioned glazing ensure that spaces feel expansive, while maintaining privacy from neighbouring properties. </p>",
