      "type": "section-intro",
      "heading": "In collaboration",
      "subheading": "Philosophy",
      "content": "<p>Prioritising open living, The Ascot Residence is tailored to an entertainment-focused lifestyle. The design needed to balance openness with privacy, employing strategically placed glazing and internal glass partitions, with a light-filled entry void to draw natural light deep into the home despite its close neighbouring boundaries.</p>\n",
