    {
      "type": "list-carousel",
      "heading": "Project Highlights",
      "description": "Timber façades, stone surfaces and thoughtful lighting reinforce a sense of warmth and subtle sophistication, balancing elegance and everyday usability. Key architectural elements include expansive stacker doors and an operable alfresco roof system that create a seamless indoor–outdoor connection and with integrated joinery, concealed services and refined material selections that work in unison to maintain clean lines while supporting functionality. Resulting in a residence that is both highly considered and effortlessly liveable.",
